(normally r-assign-cli-wiring (and ready-cli-wiring agent-claude-available) assign-to-cli-wiring-claude)
(normally r-assign-tests-pure-core (and ready-tests-pure-core agent-claude-available) assign-to-tests-pure-core-claude)
(normally r-assign-tests-receive-integration (and ready-tests-receive-integration agent-claude-available) assign-to-tests-receive-integration-claude)
